  "description": "Installation of a 1.8 metre tall exparnet mesh fence along the North West boundary of the site for the purpose of deterring vandalism and improving the security of the existing Electricity Substation located on the site. This fencing is to include 1 single-personal outwards opening gate for the purpose of accessing the Substation which is located behind it. This will be topped with anti-climb spinners which will increase the height to approximately 2.1m. This is the height of the adjoining wall. The fencing selected allowed visibility into the compound which should deter any nefarious activity going forward.",
